WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.162 --> 00:00:03.467
(boxing bell rings and trumpet sounding)

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.464
- Manny Pacquiao and Floyd Mayweather

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:08.693
could punch over 50 times in 10 seconds

00:00:08.693 --> 00:00:10.132
based on light training footage.

00:00:10.132 --> 00:00:12.055
Do you think you can punch more than that?

00:00:12.055 --> 00:00:13.072
- I'm not sure, I could try.

00:00:13.072 --> 00:00:14.117
- I think she can.

00:00:14.117 --> 00:00:15.858
- I think I would do really bad.

00:00:15.858 --> 00:00:16.603
- How many punches do you think

00:00:16.603 --> 00:00:18.414
you could throw in 10 seconds?

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.102
- About 10.

00:00:20.102 --> 00:00:21.163
- 10?

00:00:22.056 --> 00:00:23.023
That's like 40 less.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.480
- Like 12?

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.353
- 12?

00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:27.373
- I think 1000 might be
too high of a number.

00:00:27.373 --> 00:00:31.966
- But I am from Grand
Rapids like Floyd, so...

00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:32.927
We'll see, we'll see.

00:00:32.927 --> 00:00:33.926
- Home town advantage, maybe?

00:00:33.926 --> 00:00:34.399
- Yeah, maybe.

00:00:34.399 --> 00:00:37.297
- [Voiceover] Three, two, one. Go.

00:00:37.297 --> 00:00:39.985
- One, two, three, four, five,
six, seven, eight, nine, 10.

00:00:39.985 --> 00:00:42.145
- Four, five, six, seven,
eight, nine, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14.

00:00:42.145 --> 00:00:42.999
- One, two, three, four, five,

00:00:42.999 --> 00:00:44.323
six, seven, eight, nine, 10, 11, 12.

00:00:44.323 --> 00:00:47.834
(counting rapidly)

00:00:53.336 --> 00:00:54.543
- [Voiceover] Stop.

00:00:54.543 --> 00:00:56.053
- 41. I counted 41.

00:00:56.053 --> 00:00:57.562
I counted 43.

00:00:57.562 --> 00:00:58.653
48.

00:00:58.653 --> 00:00:59.528
46.

00:00:59.528 --> 00:01:00.553
45.

00:01:00.553 --> 00:01:02.878
- Alright, 51.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.991
- 54.

00:01:04.991 --> 00:01:06.912
(boxing bell rings)

00:01:07.935 --> 00:01:09.547
- Kinda surprised, a little winded,

00:01:09.547 --> 00:01:10.684
but I'm kinda surprised.

00:01:10.684 --> 00:01:12.616
- So how do you think you did, champ?

00:01:12.616 --> 00:01:15.774
- I think I probably
did good than I thought.

00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:18.254
- I heard the little girl did 41.

00:01:18.254 --> 00:01:19.888
You know what I mean? You
always like to make sure

00:01:19.888 --> 00:01:23.761
that you're kinda like in the
same range as your opponents.

00:01:23.761 --> 00:01:24.383
- That's a little girl.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:25.544
- You know what I mean?
- Yeah.

00:01:25.548 --> 00:01:27.521
I mean a fight is a fight
is a fight is a fight.

00:01:27.521 --> 00:01:30.159
- If I was getting paid as much as...

00:01:30.159 --> 00:01:31.218
What's his name? Pacquiao?

00:01:31.218 --> 00:01:32.355
- And Floyd Mayweather.

00:01:32.355 --> 00:01:34.208
- Yeah, I probably would do a lot better.

00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:35.499
- Were you guys surprised
at his performance?

00:01:35.499 --> 00:01:37.391
- I was surprised.

00:01:37.391 --> 00:01:38.949
- Thanks. Thanks fellas.

00:01:38.949 --> 00:01:40.152
- A lot of support from your friends.

00:01:40.152 --> 00:01:40.890
- Who do you guys got in the fight?

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:43.170
Do you know who Mayweather
and Pacquiao are?

00:01:44.094 --> 00:01:45.246
(laughing)

00:01:45.246 --> 00:01:47.336
- Tell him Floyd Mayweather.

00:01:47.336 --> 00:01:49.495
- Floyd Maywell.

00:01:49.495 --> 00:01:50.370
- Floyd Mayweather.

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:51.366
- Pacquiao.

00:01:51.366 --> 00:01:52.843
- Well, I'm gonna go for Floyd.

00:01:52.843 --> 00:01:55.072
- I'm gonna go ahead and say
Manny Pacquiao for the win.

00:01:55.072 --> 00:01:56.270
- So I'm gonna say Mayweather.

00:01:56.270 --> 00:01:57.849
- I'm gonna have to go with Mayweather.

00:01:57.849 --> 00:01:58.824
- Mayweather.

00:01:58.824 --> 00:01:59.776
(booing)

00:01:59.776 --> 00:02:00.725
- You were only nine less than

00:02:00.725 --> 00:02:02.242
the heavyweight champs of the world.

00:02:02.242 --> 00:02:04.157
How do you feel about that?

